source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Jira reads `h1.` as a heading without a following space, so the protection cannot depend on one.
-- input.jira --
h1.x
-- rendered.html --
<h1><a name="x"></a>x</h1>
-- want.md --
h1.x
